/* field: APB4SLVADDRESSBLOCK.DMACH0_CH_AUTOCFG.CMDRESTARTCNT, pos: [15:0] -- Automatic Command Restart Counter. Defines the number of times automatic restarting will occur at end of DMA command. Auto restarting will occur after the command is completed, including output triggering if enabled and autoreloading the registers, but it will only perfrom a link to the next command when CMDRESTARTCNT == 0. When CMDRESTARTCNT and CMDRESTARTINF are both set to '0', autorestart is disabled.*/
