/* field: VENDOR1_BLOCK.AT_CTRL_R.POST_CHANGE_DLY, pos: [20:19] -- Time taken for phase switching and stable clock output.

Specifies the maximum time (in terms of cclk cycles) that the delay line can take to switch its output phase after a change in tuning_cclk_sel or autotuning_cclk_sel.
Set a value of 0x3 for glitch free clock switching when the PHY Type is SNPS SD/eMMC phy.*/
